#. type: Title =
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generals, Wizards & Heroes at a Glance"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <svg><g><text><tspan>
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:5
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/flying-units.adoc:187
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/flying-units-at-a-glance.adoc:31
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/game-values.adoc:84
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/images/siege-and-fortresses/the-watchtower.svg:2018
#, no-wrap
msgid "Characters"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:8
msgid "Generals, Wizards and Heroes are referred to as characters."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Characters can move through and be moved through units from their own side."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:10
msgid "Characters cannot be seen, shot at or charged by the enemy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Character stands with units are ignored for the purposes of measurement and "
"calculating which stands fight."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:14
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/command.adoc:260
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/flying-units.adoc:22
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/flying-units-at-a-glance.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Orders"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Generals can give orders to any units in the army. Heroes can give orders to "
"units within 60cm. Wizards can give orders to units within 20cm."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:20
msgid ""
"When issuing orders from a Hero or Wizard, a roll of a 12 indicates a "
"blunder. The unit or brigade must make a Blunder roll."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:21
msgid "Once the General fails to issue an order no other characters can do so."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:23
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat.adoc:2
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/game-sequence.adoc:78
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/unit-questions-and-answers.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "Combat"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Characters cannot be attacked. Characters are slain if their unit is "
"destroyed in combat, by shooting or by magic."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Characters add their Attacks value as a bonus to any stand in the unit they "
"are with."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Characters fight, advance, pursue, retreat or stand with their unit unless "
"unable to do so because of terrain restrictions."
msgstr ""
